<title>GERMANY: FORECAST - German ZEW data on 6-month growth trend.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - German ZEW data on 6-month growth trend.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table gives data on expectations of growth and industry trends for the next six months issued by the ZEW Zentrum fuer Europaeische Wirtschaftsforschung GmbH research institute.</p>
<p>The percentage figures are compiled from a survey of 295 firms conducted from November 4-19. Figures in brackets show the change from October's survey.</p>
<p>ECONOMY - ASSESSMENT OF THE GENERAL ECONOMIC SITUATION</p>
<p>			   Good	    Normal	  Worse</p>
<p> Germany		 0.0  (+/-0.0) 44.6 (+1.1)   55.4 (-1.1)</p>
<p> USA		     72.2 (-4.6)   27.1 (+4.2)   0.7  (+0.4)</p>
<p> Japan		   0.7  (-1.0)   26.3 (-11.8)  73.0(+12.8)</p>
<p> Britain		 37.7 (+11.4)  58.0 (-10.9)  4.3 (-0.5)</p>
<p> France		  0.3  (-0.1)   40.1 (+3.1)   59.6 (-3.0)</p>
<p> Italy		   0.7  (-1.1)   57.7 (-2.2)   41.6 (+3.3)</p>
<p>ECONOMY - EXPECTATIONS FOR THE NEXT SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>			   Improve	 No change     Worsen</p>
<p> Germany		 76.6 (-1.9)   21.4 (+2.2)   2.0  (-0.3)</p>
<p> USA		     7.3  (-0.8)   81.2 (+1.5)   11.5 (-0.7)</p>
<p> Japan		   63.5 (-0.4)   33.0 (-1.0)   3.5  (+1.4)</p>
<p> Britain		 16.4 (-3.8)   79.3 (+3.0)   4.3  (+0.8)</p>
<p> France		  63.6 (+4.3)   33.5 (-3.7)   2.9  (-0.6)</p>
<p> Italy		   38.0 (+2.4)   56.2 (-0.7)   5.8  (-1.7)</p>
<p>INDUSTRY SECTORS - PROFIT EXPECTATIONS FOR NEXT SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>			   Improve	 No change     Worsen</p>
<p> Banks		   33.2 (-0.1)   60.3 (+3.0)   6.5  (-2.9)</p>
<p> Insurance	     21.1 (-6.7)   69.1 (+6.4)   9.8  (+0.3)</p>
<p> Automotive	    77.7 (-1.6)   20.1 (+1.5)   2.2  (+0.1)</p>
<p> Chemical		72.6 (-3.4)   24.4 (+3.6)   3.0  (-0.2)</p>
<p> Steel		   41.1 (-4.3)   49.6 (+3.2)   9.3  (+1.1)</p>
<p> Electrical	    46.6 (-15.7)  46.3 (+11.8)  7.1  (+3.9)</p>
<p> Machinery	     61.1 (-5.2)   29.3 (+1.3)   9.6  (+3.9)</p>
<p> Consumer		19.4 (-3.0)   65.6 (+1.5)   15.0 (+1.5)</p>
<p> Trade		   19.9 (+0.7)   65.8 (+2.0)   14.3 (-2.7)</p>
<p> Construction	   3.7 (-1.5)   43.6 (+1.1)   52.7 (+0.4)</p>
